url":"https://github.com/ranadeepsingh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranadeepsingh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranadeepsingh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranadeepsingh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranadeepsingh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranadeepsingh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranadeepsingh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranadeepsingh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranadeepsingh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranadeepsingh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2026-08-19T04:27:29Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T04:27:29Z","body":"## Current-head review findings addressed (`4f26c6c493`)\n\nI re-audited every Copilot review body, including suppressed findings:\n\n- **Missing revision could broaden eviction:** fixed by requiring non-empty, safe `org`, `name`, and `revision` components. Baseline proof: the new test against the prior head deleted the entire Ivy module directory; it now preserves every cache entry and skips the malformed coordinate.\n- **`rm -rf` option injection:** fixed with validated absolute roots plus `rm -rf -- \"$target\"`.\n- **`mktemp` portability/failure masking:** fixed with `${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/sbt_retry.XXXXXX` and explicit exit 2. Baseline proof: the prior head printed `mktemp`/`tee` errors, still ran sbt, and returned 0.\n- **Unset `HOME` root-level defaults:** fixed by disabling eviction unless `HOME` or a safe absolute override exists; the active thread has been replied to and resolved.\n\nAdditional audit fix: Maven diagnostics are now de-duplicated to **one request per coordinate per invocation**. Baseline proof: the prior head issued 3 probes for 3 failures; the current head issues 1.\n\nValidation: 99 CI-helper tests, pin