ers/ranadeepsingh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranadeepsingh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2026-08-19T05:16:56Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T05:16:56Z","body":"## Exact-head build attributed the remaining failure\n\nBuild **231783740** (`4f26c6c493`) exercised the new instrumentation in `UnitTests lightgbm3`:\n\n```\nsbt_retry: evicting cache entry for unresolved module: /home/vsts/.ivy2/cache/com.globalmentor/hadoop-bare-naked-local-fs\n... ivy-0.1.0.xml (8003 bytes)\n... hadoop-bare-naked-local-fs-0.1.0.jar (9106 bytes)\nsbt_retry: Maven Central probe: HTTP 429 for https://repo1.maven.org/...\n```\n\nAll five wrapper attempts and the task-level retry stayed on `repo1` and failed. This is the previously unattributed fault 2: **host-specific HTTP 429**, now measured rather than inferred.\n\nCommit `a43299f09f` adds Maven Central's official canonical endpoint (`repo.maven.apache.org`) as the next Ivy resolver. A synthetic Ivy build with a first resolver returning only 429 successfully fell through and downloaded all dependencies from the fallback. New exact-head build: **231789810**.\n\nThe other failed job in 231783740 was advisory InternalCompat Python and failed before tests during import because its current `openai` vendor code references `aiohttp.SocketTimeoutError`, which the installed `aiohttp` does not expose. It is unrelated to this PR's four changed repository files.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/SynapseML/issues/comments/5337846431/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]